menu "esp-otp status LED"

    config OTP_LED_ENABLE
        bool "Enable status LED"
        default y
        help
            Drive an indicator LED that reflects the clock-sync state: steady
            when synced within the last day, breathing when there is no time
            and no RTC, off otherwise.

    config OTP_LED_GPIO
        int "Status LED GPIO"
        depends on OTP_LED_ENABLE
        default 8
        help
            The C3 super mini's onboard blue LED is on GPIO8. GPIO8 is a
            strapping pin, but that only matters at power-on; driving it after
            boot is fine.

    config OTP_LED_ACTIVE_LOW
        bool "LED is active low"
        depends on OTP_LED_ENABLE
        default y
        help
            The C3 super mini's onboard LED lights when the pin is driven LOW.
            Enable for that board; disable for an LED wired active-high.

    config OTP_LED_INTENSITY
        int "Steady brightness percent (0-100)"
        depends on OTP_LED_ENABLE
        range 0 100
        default 30
        help
            Brightness of the steady "synced recently" state, and the peak of
            the breathing pulse.

endmenu
